  "known_parity_gaps": [
    "trailing-non-durable, durable-gap, and missing-required-field call make_finding with the fingerprint omitted. Rust returns FINGERPRINT_CODEC_UNAVAILABLE. Python emits a finding.",
    "Python int is unbounded. Rust checked i64 overflow is PYTHON_INT_UNBOUNDED.",
    "A bool is not an int. durable is exactly true.",
    "MapLookup::Borrowed is a failed borrow, not a missing key."
  ],
